<%- include('_partials/head') %>
<%- include('_partials/nav') %>

<main>
    <section class="section page-hero-about">
        <div class="container text-center">
            <h1 class="page-hero-title">Our Mission</h1>
            <p class="page-hero-subtitle">
                We are building the conversational SaaS infrastructure for the informal economy, acting as the trusted neighborhood assistant for everyone.
            </p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container">
        <div class="grid grid-2 align-center">
            <div>
                <h2 class="mb-24 text-2_5rem">A Trusted Neighbor with the Power of AI.</h2>
                <p class="text-gray mb-24 text-1_125rem">
                    Kurukoo is a multi-sided utility product that uses conversational AI to deliver on-demand SaaS tools straight to the informal economy. Our software operates like a helpful, connected local companion who is always ready to assist: learning who you are, finding trusted helpers, listing your skills, and serving up proactive opportunities nearby.
                </p>
                <p class="text-gray text-1_125rem">
                    We started with a simple observation: the most powerful tool in most pockets is a chat window. By turning that thread into a command center for escrow payments, catalog syncing, location broadcasting, and real-time coordination, we are empowering millions across Nigeria, Ghana, and beyond to trade safely and grow their income without complex tech dashboards.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="card h-400 flex-center text-5rem bg-white">
                🤝
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section container text-center">
        <h2 class="mb-60">Our Core Values</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🔒</div>
                <h3>Privacy First</h3>
                <p>Your data is yours. We never sell your personal information or reveal your phone number without your permission.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>Radical Simplicity</h3>
                <p>If it takes more than a few words to describe, it's too complex. We focus on getting things done, fast.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-icon">🤝</div>
                <h3>Community Trust</h3>
                <p>We build tools that empower neighborhoods and foster economic growth through peer-to-peer connection.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</main>

